🚨BREAKING🚨

@RepEscobar and I are leading 45 of our @HouseDemocrats colleagues in demanding ICE restore transparency in its detainee locator system.

@AP's report on ICE removing detainees from their online detainee locator system is angering for so many.

The Trump Administration must be held accountable for denying access to legal counsel and shielding detainees' whereabouts from loved ones.
